# {{vault_name}}

Personal journal entries for **{{author}}**, managed and published
automatically by GLaDOS agents across multiple hosts.

Each entry captures daily reflections, weekly summaries, and monthly
retrospectives, stored as plain Markdown files and version-controlled in Git.

## Structure

| Path | Content |
|------|---------|
| `weekly/YYYY-WNN/YYYY-MM-DD.md` | Daily entries |
| `weekly/YYYY-WNN/summary.md` | Weekly summary |
| `monthly/YYYY-MM.md` | Monthly retrospective |
| `history.md` | Long-form cumulative history |

## Makefile

A `Makefile` is generated in the vault root by the installer.

| Target | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `make update` | Runs `git pull` to fetch the latest published entries. |
| `make init` | Creates `.obsidian/` with a minimal `app.json`, initializing the vault for Obsidian. |

